<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-sanguozhi" book-id="b-sanguozhi-050" chapter-id="c-sanguozhi-050-xie" source-id="s-sanguozhi-050-xie">
  <p id="c-sanguozhi-050-xie:line022" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">吳主<persName id="c-sanguozhi-050-xie:line022:m0002" ref="572_278_cba">權</persName><persName id="c-sanguozhi-050-xie:line022:m0003" ref="ss4_3z5_x6g">謝</persName>夫人，會稽山陰人也。父<persName id="c-sanguozhi-050-xie:line022:m0015" ref="pmj_7rz_ujq">煚</persName>，漢尚書郎、徐令。<persName id="c-sanguozhi-050-xie:line022:m0025" ref="572_278_cba">權</persName>母<persName id="c-sanguozhi-050-xie:line022:m0027" ref="lm8_q5h_5uy">吳</persName>，為<persName id="c-sanguozhi-050-xie:line022:m0030" ref="572_278_cba">權</persName>聘以為妃，愛幸有寵。後<persName id="c-sanguozhi-050-xie:line022:m0042" ref="572_278_cba">權</persName>納姑孫<persName id="c-sanguozhi-050-xie:line022:m0046" ref="75m_kfd_6qo">徐氏</persName>，欲令<persName id="c-sanguozhi-050-xie:line022:m0051" ref="ss4_3z5_x6g">謝</persName>下之，<persName id="c-sanguozhi-050-xie:line022:m0055" ref="ss4_3z5_x6g">謝</persName>不肯，由是失志。早卒。後十餘年，弟<persName id="c-sanguozhi-050-xie:line022:m0073" ref="khh_wth_u1d">承</persName>拜五官郎中，稍遷長沙東部都尉、武陵太守，撰《後漢書》百餘卷。</p>
  <p id="c-sanguozhi-050-xie:line022-pei01-01" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_pei_songzhi_note"><persName id="c-sanguozhi-050-xie:line022-pei01-01:m0000" ref="pmj_7rz_ujq">煚</persName>子<persName id="c-sanguozhi-050-xie:line022-pei01-01:m0002" ref="khh_wth_u1d">承</persName>撰《後漢書》，稱<persName id="c-sanguozhi-050-xie:line022-pei01-01:m0011" ref="pmj_7rz_ujq">煚</persName>幼以仁孝為行，明達有令才。<persName id="c-sanguozhi-050-xie:line022-pei01-01:m0025" ref="pmj_7rz_ujq">煚</persName>弟<persName id="c-sanguozhi-050-xie:line022-pei01-01:m0027" ref="47n_rbr_40l">貞</persName>，履蹈法度，篤學尚義，舉孝廉，建昌長，卒官。</p>
  <p id="c-sanguozhi-050-xie:line022-pei02-01" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_pei_songzhi_note">《會稽典錄》曰：<persName id="c-sanguozhi-050-xie:line022-pei02-01:m0008" ref="khh_wth_u1d">承</persName>字<persName id="c-sanguozhi-050-xie:line022-pei02-01:m0010" ref="khh_wth_u1d">偉平</persName>，博學洽聞，嘗所知見，終身不忘。子<persName id="c-sanguozhi-050-xie:line022-pei02-01:m0029" ref="khh_wth_u1d_A">崇</persName>揚威將軍，<persName id="c-sanguozhi-050-xie:line022-pei02-01:m0035" ref="khh_wth_u1d_A">崇</persName>弟<persName id="c-sanguozhi-050-xie:line022-pei02-01:m0037" ref="ist_8ta_63l">勗</persName>吳郡太守，竝知名。</p>
</text>
